UPSTREAM SOURCE AND ATTRIBUTION

The arm is derived from the SO-101 arm by TheRobotStudio, in collaboration
with Hugging Face:
  https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100
  Pinned commit: eecbe3e0a9ebb23e25ad7b2759b03884c6660903
  License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (text in LICENSE-Apache-2.0-upstream.txt)

The mechanism layout and servo-interface context derive from that source.
ArmDojo changes: new base stand and case cap, split yaw carrier, open-frame
servo carriers, new link lengths (shoulder-elbow 165 mm, elbow-wrist 145 mm),
new elbow, wrist and rotating gripper, inner TPU gripper liners with rigid
keepers, front/rear wrist-roll support, and a camera platform. No upstream
files are redistributed unchanged in this repository.

Servo dimensions were checked against the servo manufacturer's CAD model, used
only as a local reference; that model is not included here.

